<view class="page"><view class="title">身份信息</view><view wx:if="{{user}}" class="muted small" style="word-break:break-all;margin-bottom:20rpx">内部用户 ID：{{user.id}}</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!user}}" class="card"><button class="primary" bindtap="login">先登录</button></view><block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="subtitle">{{user.verification === 'approved' ? '身份已通过核验' : user.verification === 'pending' ? '身份待审核' : user.verification === 'rejected' ? '身份已拒绝，可重新提交' : '提交身份核验'}}</view><view wx:if="{{user.verification === 'approved'}}"><view class="kv"><text>姓名</text><text>{{user.name}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>学工号</text><text>{{user.studentNo}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>师生类型</text><text>{{user.identityType === 'teacher' ? '教师' : '学生'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text>联系电话</text><text>{{user.phone}}</text></view><view class="muted">管理员权限为独立授权，与教师身份分开。</view></view><view wx:elif="{{user.verification === 'pending'}}" class="muted">负责人核验完成前，不能查询日程或提交预约。</view><view wx:else><view class="notice">仅限虚构测试身份演示。不得输入校园密码。选择“教师”须经负责人批准后才生效。</view><label class="field"><text class="label">姓名</text><input value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="field" maxlength="50" /></label><label class="field"><text class="label">学工号</text><input value="{{studentNo}}" data-field="studentNo" bindinput="field" maxlength="30" /></label><view class="field"><text class="label">申请师生类型</text><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="type"><view class="picker">{{types[typeIndex]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><label class="field"><text class="label">手机号（仅格式校验）</text><input type="number" value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="field" maxlength="11" /></label><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交人工核验</button></view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.profile.name}} · {{item.profile.studentNo}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.status === 'pending' ? '待审核' : item.status === 'approved' ? '已通过' : '已拒绝'}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.reason}}">拒绝原因：{{item.reason}}</view></view></block></view>
